{"id":"e213840be81d01b8","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-ce-oracle-invalidation.md","title":"c.e. oracle 的旧公理永久失效","display":"lem-ce-oracle-invalidation — c.e. oracle 的旧公理永久失效","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-ce-oracle-invalidation","aliases":["20-lem-ce-oracle-invalidation"],"display":"lem-ce-oracle-invalidation — c.e. oracle 的旧公理永久失效","chapter":"5","section":"5.5.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§5.5.3 的 oracle 公理承诺","source_printed_pages":[123,124],"source_pdf_pages":[158,159],"depends_on":["[[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-ce-oracle-invalidation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-ce-oracle-invalidation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-ce-oracle-invalidation — c.e. oracle 的旧公理永久失效"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.5.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§5.5.3 的 oracle 公理承诺"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>123</span><span>124</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>158</span><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c803835be7de786d\" href=\"?note=c803835be7de786d\" title=\"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms\">20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\\subseteq C_t\\subseteq C_v\">\\(C_s\\subseteq C_t\\subseteq C_v\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;t\\le v\">\\(s&lt;t\\le v\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=C_s\\upharpoonright u\">\\(\\sigma=C_s\\upharpoonright u\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=C_t\\upharpoonright w\">\\(\\tau=C_t\\upharpoonright w\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_t\\upharpoonright u\\ne\\sigma\">\\(C_t\\upharpoonright u\\ne\\sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\ge u\">\\(w\\ge u\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c803835be7de786d\" href=\"?note=c803835be7de786d\" title=\"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms\">20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce-oracle-invalidation}\\vdash\n\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\quad\\land\\quad\\sigma\\npreceq C_v.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce-oracle-invalidation}\\vdash\n\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\quad\\land\\quad\\sigma\\npreceq C_v.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z&lt;u\">\\(z&lt;u\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 时为 0、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 时为 1；c.e. 枚举以后保持 1。新公理若以至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 长的当前 oracle 前缀为条件，便与旧前缀不相容。因此允许新输出的同时，必须保证新 use 包含这个见证；只知道旧公理不再匹配真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，不足以保证整个公理集相容。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.5.3 的 oracle 公理承诺；印刷页 123, 124；PDF 第 158, 159 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"c803835be7de786d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"c803835be7de786d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C_s\\subseteq C_t\\subseteq C_v","display":false},{"tex":"s<t\\le v","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=C_s\\upharpoonright u","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=C_t\\upharpoonright w","display":false},{"tex":"C_t\\upharpoonright u\\ne\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"w\\ge u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce-oracle-invalidation}\\vdash\n\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\quad\\land\\quad\\sigma\\npreceq C_v.","display":true},{"tex":"z<u","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false}],"bytes":1397,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-ce-oracle-invalidation]] — 章 5；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-ce-oracle-invalidation]]"}],"outgoing":["c803835be7de786d"]}